@startuml
left to right direction

actor "后台运营" as Admin
actor "定时/异步任务" as Job
actor "充值/订单服务" as PaySvc
actor "清结算服务" as Liquidate
actor "审核/风控" as Risk
actor "钱包Hub平台" as Hub

rectangle "商户余额变更服务" {
  usecase UC_Lock as "获取/释放商户余额锁\nMERCHANT_BALANCE_LOCK"
  usecase UC_Deposit as "充值成功账变"
  usecase UC_Withdraw as "提现成功结算账变"
  usecase UC_WithdrawJob as "提现任务账变处理"
  usecase UC_Adjust as "后台人工调账/手动对账"
  usecase UC_AdjustReject as "上分/调账审批拒绝"
  usecase UC_HubAdjust as "钱包Hub调账"
}

PaySvc --> UC_Deposit
Liquidate --> UC_Withdraw
Job --> UC_WithdrawJob
Admin --> UC_Adjust
Risk --> UC_AdjustReject
Hub --> UC_HubAdjust

UC_Deposit ..> UC_Lock : 请求
UC_Withdraw ..> UC_Lock : 请求
UC_WithdrawJob ..> UC_Lock : 请求
UC_Adjust ..> UC_Lock : 请求
UC_AdjustReject ..> UC_Lock : 请求
UC_HubAdjust ..> UC_Lock : 请求

note right of UC_Lock
- 键前缀: LOCK_MERCHANT_BALANCE_SUM + merchantId
- 默认等待: 8s, 租期: 10s
- try-with-resources 自动释放 或 finally 解锁
end note
@enduml